    "description": "A FindSet/Next loop builds an enumerator from the fields selected for load. Accessing an unloaded field triggers a JIT load. When the record is passed by value, the copy does not share that enumerator: the JIT loads the copy and leaves the enumerator unchanged, so every later Next() JIT-loads again.",
